# Extracting and Updating Rule Evaluation Workflow

1. Verify rule updates per newly stored memory
2. Identify when `RuleEvaluator.evaluate()` is invoked (once per memory)
3. Understand trigger conditions for creating or updating rules
4. Determine the scope of revisited rules during batch execution
5. Timing and frequency of `applyTimeDecay()`
6. Evaluate potential decrease in rule score based on memory absence
